# Mission (read docs/ja/AGENTS.md)

- The **mission must never be violated** — design and verification serve physics, not LLM convenience.
- **No self-dealing:** virtual pass/fail must not use LLM subjectivity; use simulation output + deterministic checkers.
- After code changes, run `./scripts/ci-local.sh` (or `pytest` at minimum).
- Canonical run path: `python3 -m tools.cli run …` (see docs/en/cli.md).
